# Generated imagery.
#
# The storefront hero art, the floating objects and the product photography are
# all rendered assets, not source. Together they are several megabytes of PNG
# that would churn a binary blob into history every time a render is retouched.
#
# NOTE: a fresh clone therefore has no hero art, and the storefront will render
# broken images until public/ is restored out of band. Keep a copy somewhere
# durable before relying on this repo alone.
public/

# Internal planning documents.
#
# These hold the full product strategy, demo choreography and the reasoning
# about what to claim versus not claim to judges. They stay on disk for the
# team and out of the published repository. README.md and HANDOFF.md carry
# everything a reader of this repo actually needs.
VISA_HACKATHON_FINAL_CONTEXT.md
VISA_HACKATHON_SETUP.md
VISA_HACKATHON_BUILD_PROMPT_OPUS.md
